================================================================================
PUBLISHED PACKAGE CONTENTS
================================================================================

`@tynd/cli` publishes a small launcher for the Rust `tynd` executable plus the
dependency-free TypeScript `TyndConfig` surface, schemas, and project templates.
It does not publish static shell-completion files.

The package has no third-party JavaScript runtime dependency. `@tynd/host-src`
and `@tynd/tooling` are Tynd packages licensed under Apache-2.0. Native
executable notices are provided by `@tynd/tooling` and its selected platform
package.
